    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0924a71d645434d7e3c42a1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "寮内の風紀にも気を配らないと！！\r\nまずは…夜な夜な謎のラップが\r\n聞こえる騒音問題の対処っスね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "234bcedebf2504dff8897837b27817635fd68b8d80242a001654c09e375d49e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "400002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/400002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43c36244fbea6bdc4826e9da",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我实在很不想弄乱城市帮我\r\n整理好的发型，但……唔哦哦，\r\n海风来啦──！我不会输的──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3552d65362210bc73c58b2c9ea70e899e11aef7b4d1ccfff5d96d53c4babad11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "400003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/400003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:411267ec11e7744f2abf1af8",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论是感谢祭前！还是感谢祭中！\r\n纠察队员都不会停止巡逻！\r\n一抓到有人违反规则就吹哨！",
      "source_fingerprint": "203e7f9dac2d5859a36644b8830d8e0e3cbbd76e7b7718d6cf2cdd31940902d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "400005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/400005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d5765dce21e363da3f1da8c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有人求助我必定出手！\r\n有人需要我就一定会出现！\r\n这就是我的原则！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98f77196efc5bfb4970751fa7c9f5eefa695cc82d0050d5b9fd604dfa7be8057",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "400007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/400007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:560eba61d5f5642f837373ff",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "内心散漫就代表纪律散漫！\r\n专注于恢复精神也是\r\n纠察队长的重要责任！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9b43b8037c15a2058ddcd3ac1d577198c97d7d2ab7802962735dcb15a099fef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "400008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/400008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcbee730f90cd4ce683776dc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，这是！！\r\n唔喔喔喔喔！！喝啊啊啊！！\r\n又矫正一次纪律了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "354ace874eaeee5489c1d8be10b78de2ba9af93f114abc021fe98cd2536c4377",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "40001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/40001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:489dbcfc15c3b16e283a4e21",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "こちらはイベントミッションっス\r\n楽しんでるっスか？休憩がてら、\r\n報酬受け取ってくといいっスよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b4a48f195032a4a4c998a8805de467f7bcd0105a06ed69a99e0bf9c992f7b24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "400012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/400012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b394265ae57d5ae0d167b813",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "お疲れっした！熱い思い出が\r\n作れてたら幸いっス！お土産も\r\n受け取って帰ってください！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62820bd506a3723cfb09c810a655aaa902ef8c2df21ceecf271e3aee3e756576",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
